<title>USA: Moore unit wins Budget Rent a Car pact.</title>
<headline>Moore unit wins Budget Rent a Car pact.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST, Ill. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moore Corp Ltd said Wednesday its U.S. subsidiary will provide print management services to  Budget Rent a Car Corp under a five-year contract worth more than $10 million.</p>
<p>Moore said it will produce all forms, labels and other printed materials for Budget, in addition to setting up a customized customer service ordering process and a comprehensive distribution system. Moore may also provide marketing, collateral material and database management.</p>
<p>Budget is a privately held company with close ties to Ford Motor Co.</p>
<p>Toronto-based Moore is a leading business forms maker.</p>
<p>Its stock was up 1/4 at 19-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
